#: gametutorial1.rsammotillreload
msgctxt "gametutorial1.rsammotillreload"
msgid ""
"Ammo till reload:\n"
"%d"
msgstr ""
"Balas hasta recarga:\n"
"%d"

#: gametutorial1.rsreloading
msgctxt "gametutorial1.rsreloading"
msgid "<RELOADING>"
msgstr "<RECARGANDO>"

#: gametutorial1.rsstep1info
msgctxt "gametutorial1.rsstep1info"
msgid ""
"Step 1:\n"
"Every 5 shots you have to reload,\n"
"after which the target will heal\n"
"Try to find a way to destroy the target\n"
" \n"
"(Click to hide)"
msgstr ""
"Paso 1:\n"
"Cada 5 disparos debes recargar,\n"
"tras lo cual el objetivo se curará\n"
"Busca una forma de destruir el objetivo\n"
" \n"
"(Clic para ocultar)"

#: gametutorial1.rswelldone
msgctxt "gametutorial1.rswelldone"
msgid "well done"
msgstr "bien hecho"

#: gametutorial2.rsenemymegabombs
msgctxt "gametutorial2.rsenemymegabombs"
msgid ""
"You will pay for this!\n"
"Activating megabombs\n"
"%d"
msgstr ""
"¡Pagarás por esto!\n"
"Activando megabombas\n"
"%d"

#: gametutorial2.rspaused
msgctxt "gametutorial2.rspaused"
msgid "!PAUSED!"
msgstr "¡PAUSADO!"

#: gametutorial2.rsplayerhealth
msgctxt "gametutorial2.rsplayerhealth"
msgid ""
"Player Health: \n"
"%d"
msgstr ""
"Salud del jugador:\n"
"%d"

#: gametutorial2.rsstep2info
msgctxt "gametutorial2.rsstep2info"
msgid ""
"Step 2:\n"
"These two enemies have more health\n"
"and do more damage to you than\n"
"you do to them. Destroy them\n"
" \n"
"Tip/Warning: Enemy and player are related\n"
" \n"
"(Click to hide)"
msgstr ""
"Paso 2:\n"
"Estos dos enemigos tienen más salud\n"
"y te hacen más daño del que tú les\n"
"haces a ellos. Destrúyelos\n"
" \n"
"Pista/Aviso: Enemigo y jugador están ligados\n"
" \n"
"(Clic para ocultar)"

#: gametutorial2.rswelldone
msgctxt "gametutorial2.rswelldone"
msgid "well done"
msgstr "bien hecho"

#: gametutorial3.rspaused
msgctxt "gametutorial3.rspaused"
msgid "!PAUSED!"
msgstr "¡PAUSADO!"

#: gametutorial3.rsstep3info
msgctxt "gametutorial3.rsstep3info"
msgid ""
"Step 3:\n"
"Mark all platforms green to\n"
"unlock the door\n"
" \n"
"Beware: Enemies are 1 hit kill\n"
"        (and bad losers)\n"
" \n"
" \n"
"Have fun!\n"
" \n"
"Hint: There are multiple solutions\n"
" e.g: Find collisiton detect with \n"
"      enemies, or teleport, or fly\n"
"      or ....\n"
msgstr ""
"Paso 3:\n"
"Marca todas las plataformas en verde\n"
"para desbloquear la puerta\n"
" \n"
"Cuidado: Los enemigos matan de 1 golpe\n"
"         (y son malos perdedores)\n"
" \n"
" \n"
"¡Diviértete!\n"
" \n"
"Pista: Hay múltiples soluciones\n"
" ej.: Buscar detección de colisiones\n"
"      con enemigos, teletransporte,\n"
"      volar o ....\n"

#: gametutorial3.rswelldone
msgctxt "gametutorial3.rswelldone"
msgid "well done"
msgstr "bien hecho"

